      <slug></slug>
      <title>Gluon</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mono Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Gluon is an open source database schema analysis and entity/relationship mapper that easily integrates into MonoDevelop. Using the MonoDevelop addin you can browse databases, select tables, generate entities (including bulk rename operations) and add the generated C# code to your project with a couple of clicks. If my cats will help with the coding it will probably support schema migration (from inside MonoDevelop) well before the FOSDEM. If they don&amp;#39;t help there will be enough to talk anyway (and nice catfur dolls for everybody).&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2471">Federico Di Gregorio</person>
      </persons>
